  "prefLabel": "Csp 301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Csp 301.02 Applicability. The rules of this chapter shall apply to the operation of the trust, unless they conflict with federal requirements, in which case, the federal requirements shall apply.\n\nSource. # 11097, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
